<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P rates EFIC dual currency Jan 1999 bond 'AA'.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates EFIC dual currency Jan 1999 bond 'AA'.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's on Monday said it had assigned its 'AA' rating to Export Finance and Insurance Corporation's (EFIC) 10 billion yen dual currency yen/NZ dollar samurai bonds maturing January 28, 1999.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating reflected that of its guarantor, the Commonwealth of Australia. The foreign currency rating outlook was positive.</p>
